{"metadata": {"team_id": "ucsc", "run_id": "UCSC-base-ensemble", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-2_7", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "For Head and Shoulders, you have a few options for managing an oily scalp and oily hair. The **Head & Shoulders Instant Oil Control Shampoo** is specifically formulated to tackle excess oils, providing a deep clean for both scalp and hair. It's pH balanced and gentle enough for daily use on all hair types, and also helps control dandruff. The **Head & Shoulders Classic Clean Anti-Dandruff Shampoo** is another option that removes excess oil and moisturizes the scalp and hair. If you prefer a two-in-one product, the **Classic Clean 2-in-1 Dandruff Shampoo And Conditioner** controls oil and scalp itchiness, offering sufficient moisture for fine or oily hair. While some users report increased sebum production with Head & Shoulders, others find it works well for their oily hair.\n\nFor OUAI, consider the **OUAI Detox Shampoo** as a clarifying option to remove product buildup, which can contribute to oiliness. It's typically recommended for weekly use. The **OUAI Scalp & Body Scrub** can also be beneficial for an oily scalp, as it exfoliates to clear away dead skin and oils. For in-between washes, the **OUAI Super Dry Shampoo** is designed for fine, oily hair to remove buildup and cleanse the scalp without water. OUAI also offers a quiz to help you find their specific shampoos and conditioners (like their FINE line) that best suit your hair type and concerns, including an oily scalp.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0042-65-10707:4": 4.706117457894978, "clueweb22-en0001-30-00196:7": 4.468210670238198, "clueweb22-en0006-94-06164:5": 4.301970591445802, "clueweb22-en0020-41-20219:1": 4.297202392493043, "clueweb22-en0035-11-06183:1": 4.274042134914238, "clueweb22-en0008-10-15438:7": 4.258614407687826, "clueweb22-en0031-71-03560:1": 4.218748631900175, "clueweb22-en0000-06-13897:4": 4.20514712562599, "clueweb22-en0042-65-10707:5": 4.19370